.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH tix-repo-clone 1  "clone " 
.SH NAME
tix\-repo\-clone \- Clone registered repositories to their code paths
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtix repo clone\fR [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-log\-level\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-all\fR|\fIREPO_ALIASES\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Clone registered repositories to their code paths
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-a\fR, \fB\-\-all\fR
Clone every registered repository not already on disk
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to the global config file (overrides TIX_CONFIG_PATH and the platform default)
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
Output format for commands that support it (also forwarded to plugins as \-\-tix\-output)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
json
.IP \(bu 2
toml
.IP \(bu 2
default
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-log\-level\fR \fI<LOG_LEVEL>\fR
Set the log level (trace, debug, info, warn, error)
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Set the log level to trace (shorthand for \-\-log\-level trace)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Set the log level to warn (shorthand for \-\-log\-level warn)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIREPO_ALIASES\fR]
Registered aliases to clone
